# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# scratch: commit messages and one-off temp files must not be repo-local
*.tmp
.scratch/
.shots/
.vite.log
*.bak

# Secrets. Nothing here is needed to build or run the app; everything here is
# needed to SIGN a release, and a signing key in the repository is a signing key
# in everyone's clone forever (git history is not editable in practice).
#
# The updater key lives OUTSIDE the repo, at ~/.tauri/toolbox-updater.key — that
# is the whole point of this block: if it is ever copied into the tree by hand,
# it must not be committable. Same for the Windows code-signing certificate, if
# one is ever bought.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
